WEBVTT

00:06.881 --> 00:07.527
Good afternoon.

00:07.954 --> 00:11.190
My name is Alex, and I'm calling on
behalf of the CCA Alumni Network.

00:11.681 --> 00:15.545
Before we begin, may I confirm
I'm speaking with Angelica Gold?

00:15.666 --> 00:16.226
Yes.

00:16.581 --> 00:17.191
Wonderful.

00:17.350 --> 00:21.617
CCA. I have you down as graduating in
2025 from the Interaction Design program.

00:21.617 --> 00:24.077
how would you describe
your experience there?

00:25.317 --> 00:31.304
My experience at CCA was amazing
Um, I did a lot of prototyping

00:31.371 --> 00:35.396
and a lot of design in general,
and I graduated, and I loved it.

00:35.982 --> 00:39.918
You mentioned doing a lot of
prototyping and design work and that

00:39.918 --> 00:42.014
you genuinely loved the experience.

00:42.574 --> 00:46.022
did any particular project or
aspect of the program stand out

00:46.022 --> 00:49.430
to you or maybe influence the
direction you took after graduation?

00:50.559 --> 00:55.659
I really loved the visual design aspects
and business side of building a brand,

00:55.839 --> 00:56.375
Excellent.

00:56.687 --> 00:59.551
The network is designed to share your
information thoughtfully, entirely

00:59.551 --> 01:00.631
according to your preferences.

01:01.041 --> 01:04.241
In general, how open are you to
being contacted by other alumni?

01:04.549 --> 01:09.462
I would like to only limit my
contact to people who are hiring

01:09.462 --> 01:10.982
and/or can provide a job to me.

01:10.982 --> 01:11.246
Got it.

01:11.246 --> 01:13.294
You'd welcome introductions to
hiring managers, mentors, and

01:13.294 --> 01:15.870
peers in automotive design since
your main goal is to find a job.

01:16.222 --> 01:17.078
Thanks for clarifying that.

01:17.382 --> 01:21.182
And finally, when are you generally
available for this kind of communication?

01:21.470 --> 01:23.080
Since I'm unemployed, any time is fine.

01:23.497 --> 01:25.227
Your profile is looking very complete.

01:25.577 --> 01:27.717
It's been a genuine pleasure
speaking with you, and we really

01:27.717 --> 01:30.117
look forward to connecting you
with your fellow CCA alumni.

01:30.547 --> 01:31.352
Cool.
